00:01:14.859 --> 00:01:16.599
back to our default.

19
00:01:16.599 --> 00:01:19.040
And this is where we want to start.

20
00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:23.599
I'm going to go over to our Place Actors, and I'm going to search for Post, and I'm going

21
00:01:23.599 --> 00:01:29.180
to look through a post-processing volume, and go ahead and drag it into our scene.

22
00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:33.109
And here we can see we have post-processing volume too.

23
00:01:33.109 --> 00:01:38.629
Now by default, our post-processing volume has a shape, and we can edit the shape.

