00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:30.629
So to do that, I'm going to scroll down here in the Details panel, and what we're

37
00:02:30.629 --> 00:02:35.870
looking for is underneath our post-processing volume settings, we want to use Infinite Extent

38
00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:36.969
Unbound.

39
00:02:36.969 --> 00:02:40.150
So if we check that, and nothing's going to happen because we haven't adjusted any

40
00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:44.509
settings, what this means now is it's ignoring the shape, and it's just going to apply

41
00:02:44.509 --> 00:02:46.330
