00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:59.660
And really that just has to do with our directional light.

76
00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:04.980
Because we created it through our environment light mixer, it brought in the directional

77
00:05:04.980 --> 00:05:07.980
light with an intensity of 10 lux.

78
00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:12.420
So by simply adjusting this post-processing volume, it's just going to help us again,

79
00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:15.060
