00:05:27.449 --> 00:05:28.810
cool things that you can do.

84
00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:34.209
For example, chromatic aberration, I can set this way high, start my offset.

85
00:05:34.209 --> 00:05:38.050
You'll see that we can do a bunch of different artistic effects, again, whatever your heart

86
00:05:38.050 --> 00:05:40.529
desires, feel free to.

87
00:05:40.529 --> 00:05:46.500
Local exposure is another great way to get some very fine granular control.

